            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "DEPARTMENT OF SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY (VIGYAN AUR PRODYOGIKI VIBHAG) 1 Formulation of policy statements and guidelines on science and technology and the following through their implementation"
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "2",
                "text": "National Committee on Science and Technology."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "3",
                "text": "Promotion of new areas of science and technology."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "4",
                "text": "Oceanography including the scientific and technological aspects of the seabed and ocean floor."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "5",
                "text": "Environment and Ecology."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "6",
                "text": "Futurology."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "7",
                "text": "All matters concerning the Council of Scientific and Industrial Research"
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "8",
                "text": "Survey of India and National Atlas Organisation."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "9",
                "text": "Botanical Survey of India."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "10",
                "text": "Zoological Survey of India."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "11",
                "text": "National Research Development Corporation."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "12",
                "text": "Annual Session of the Indian Science Congress Association."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "13",
                "text": "Central Board of Geophysics."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "14",
                "text": "The Pan-Indian Ocean Science Association."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "15",
                "text": "Indian National Scientific Documentation Centre."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "16",
                "text": "Coordination of areas of science and technology in which a number of institutions and departments have interests and capabilities."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "17",
                "text": "Undertaking or financially sponsoring scientific and technological surveys, research, design, development where necessary."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "18",
                "text": "Grants to national research institutions, scientific associations and gcientific bodies, including the Indian National Science Academy, the Indian Academy of Science and the National Academy of Sciences"
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "19",
                "text": "All matters concerning domestic technology particularly the promotion of ventures involving the commercialisation of such technology."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "20",
                "text": "International Scientific and Technological Affairs including-"
              },
              {
                "type": "item",
                "num": "a",
                "text": "the negotiation and implementation of Scientific and Technological Cooperation Agreements and responsibility for scientific and technological aspects of activities of international organisation; and"
              },
              {
                "type": "item",
                "num": "b",
                "text": "appointment of Scientific Attaches abroad. 1 0"
              },
              {
                "type": "note",
                "text": "NOTE. These functions shall be exercise by the Department of Science and Technology (Vievan aur Prodvogiki Vibhag) in close cooperation with the Ministry of External Affairs (Videsh Mantralaya)."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "21",
                "text": "Matters commonly affecting scientific and technological institutions e.g financial, personnel, purchase and import policies and practices."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "22",
                "text": "Matters relating to creation of a pool for temporary placement of Indian scientists and technologists returning from abroad"
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "23",
                "text": "All other measures needed for the promotion of science and technology and their application to the development and security to the nation."
              }
            ],
